		Heading 1:
			Text: Matrix formats
		Paragraph: `Barcode format` chooses the symbology. A Data Matrix is square, with modules of 0.5 mm. A GS1 Data Matrix carries GS1 data, each application identifier in parentheses before its value. A PDF417 has modules of 0.33 by 1 mm and keeps its proportion.
